{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Run Quad Run",
    "steam_appid": 3733970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/95d0c5753fa4e1475d562943ccd23824.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span>Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you a lot of new enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With 500 unique levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/d50fe4115e0404da1adb7cfc6e83d81a.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500 Levels to Finish and Speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Long Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Speed modifiers for starter players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race fast to Finish levels within the Target Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Run Levels with World Speedrun for Hardcore Players and Real Runners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/3bec667608a1514984014d0ab046dd1a.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/63fe5b4935600f01b114c93c56337255.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're on the hardcore side and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we also have a death counter and a global timer to count your cumulative stats. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/95d0c5753fa4e1475d562943ccd23824.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span>Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you a lot of new enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With 500 unique levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/d50fe4115e0404da1adb7cfc6e83d81a.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500 Levels to Finish and Speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Long Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Speed modifiers for starter players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race fast to Finish levels within the Target Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Run Levels with World Speedrun for Hardcore Players and Real Runners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/3bec667608a1514984014d0ab046dd1a.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/63fe5b4935600f01b114c93c56337255.avif?t=1752841663\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're on the hardcore side and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we also have a death counter and a global timer to count your cumulative stats. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p>",
    "short_description": "Run Quad Run is a top-down skill based parkour game where you escape from the evil shapes to recover the lost artifacts of Cubicland. Navigate through various worlds with different enemies and master your reflex skills in the world of cubes.",
